                <mxCell id="Tkg7loyrQP702Ur1c9dN-204" value="We have this in the current design, but it&#39;s not needed. We do simple things on success and most flags don&#39;t have custom behavior so even if they do we can implement functions like:&lt;br&gt;success()&lt;br&gt;notReady()&lt;br&gt;disconnect()&lt;br&gt;...&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;and use them on the spot instead of passing the context around&amp;nbsp;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="Tkg7loyrQP702Ur1c9dN-203" vertex="1">
